{"overview":"وقتی دختر وانگ وی توسط یک سازمان جنایتکار ربوده می‌شود و به‌دلیل فساد پلیس از مداخله امتناع می‌کند، وی به‌تنهایی به جستجوی او می‌پردازد؛ تنها همراه او نوین، روزنامه‌نگار مصمم که همسرش نیز به‌طور مرموز ناپدید شده، است؛ این دو نفر نامحتمل در یک نبرد شدید هنرهای رزمی با ربایندگان روبه‌رو می‌شوند، به‌دلیل تمایل سوزاننده به انتقام.","tagline":"","overview_en":"When Wang Wei's daughter is abducted by a criminal organization and law enforcement declines to intervene due to corruption, Wei embarks on a solo mission to find her. His sole ally is Navin, a determined journalist whose wife has also mysteriously disappeared. Together, this improbable pair confronts the kidnappers in a fierce martial arts confrontation, driven by an intense desire for retribution.","tagline_en":"To save their loved ones, they will fight everyone.","runtime":113,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["谷垣健治"],"crew_en":["Kenji Tanigaki"],"countries":["HK","CN","US"],"cast":[{"name":"谢苗","role":"Wang Wei","photo":"/naouuajtSe2GzxQfobcOd0GW9JW.jpg","en":"Xie Miao"},{"name":"جو تسلیم","role":"Navin","photo":"/bk2j6Oa8T02KtvpD4qOXXGJe4Vy.jpg","en":"Joe Taslim"},{"name":"杨恩又","role":"Rainy","photo":"","en":"Yang Enyou"},{"name":"Yayan Ruhian","role":"Tak","photo":"/y8ZLh6FZMuLFw8PhqDxcEsyozjJ.jpg"},{"name":"ฉันทธนิสา ตัง","role":"Matia","photo":"/73xhAKFbeNSlJTwUCsQCAtryLYS.jpg","en":"JeeJa Yanin"},{"name":"Brian Le","role":"Ho","photo":"/cdtKmPpmBrnVAiqFQVE4urxu0ko.jpg"},{"name":"岩永ジョーイ","role":"Pak Lung","photo":"/iwZXKVNZioAZaej7wUbOeYx1uLd.jpg","en":"Joey Iwanaga"},{"name":"สหจักร บุญธนกิจ","role":"Mr. Song","photo":"/a36MI02S0f11bJZjBoxkZTsUDAK.jpg","en":"Sahajak Boonthanakit"},{"name":"มนัสนันท์ พันเลิศวงศ์สกุล","role":"Yadong","photo":"/zj09X1mHTrRNiyGmKpbTjJyierc.jpg","en":"Manatsanun Panlertwongskul"},{"name":"วินัย เวียงย่างกุ้ง","role":"Donkey Head","photo":"","en":"Winai Wiangyangkung"},{"name":"สหัสชัย ชุมรุม","role":"Kun Tai Luo","photo":"/z2miLGPhdsZz7gnhpVe